Package: facspseudocolor
Title: Analyze Signal Versus DNA Flow Cytometry Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Chris", "Sansam", email = "sansamcl@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Validates, normalizes, quantifies, and plots event-level flow
    cytometry data for EdU incorporation, a protein of interest, or
    phospho-histone H3 versus DNA content. The package begins with event-level
    comma-separated files or in-memory data frames and does not perform FlowJo
    workspace processing.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
